{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"slug":[{"Plain":"MO"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"MO"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦论","text":"稳定同伦论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\mathrm{MO}$ 是万有 "},{"Local":{"url":"Thom谱","text":"Thom 谱"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>$\\mathrm{MO}$ 是 $\\mathrm{O}$ 在"},{"Local":{"url":"球谱","text":"球谱"}},{"Plain":"上作用的"},{"Local":{"url":"余不动点","text":"余不动点"}},{"Plain":", 即如下余极限,\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{MO}\\simeq\\operatorname{colim}\\big(\\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{O} \\overset{J}{\\to} \\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{GL}_1(\\mathbb S) \\to \\mathsf {Sp}\\big),\r\n$$\n也即 $\\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{O}$ 上万有球丛的全空间.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\pi_n \\mathrm{MO}$ 可自然等同于闭 $n$ 维流形的"},{"Local":{"url":"配边","text":"配边"}},{"Plain":"类的集合.</p>\n"}]}}